WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.239
Rex looked up. "Sorry!"

2
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.956
A dinosaur rubbed her leg.

3
00:00:08.957 --> 00:00:11.913
She had a beak and wings.

4
00:00:11.914 --> 00:00:14.343
She also had a bag.

5
00:00:14.344 --> 00:00:20.058
The dinosaur frowned.

6
00:00:20.059 --> 00:00:23.412
"Don't try to eat me!"

7
00:00:23.413 --> 00:00:33.934
Rex stood up. "Don't worry.

8
00:00:33.935 --> 00:00:35.971
I'm friendly!

9
00:00:35.972 --> 00:00:40.840
I'm helping Sid.

10
00:00:40.841 --> 00:00:45.200
His tail is stuck."

11
00:00:45.201 --> 00:00:51.857
Rex went back to Sid.

12
00:00:51.858 --> 00:00:55.362
The new dinosaur went too.

13
00:00:55.363 --> 00:00:58.517
"I'm Tor," she said.

14
00:00:58.518 --> 00:01:01.319
"Hello," Rex said.

15
00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:05.066
"I'm Rex. And this is Sid."

16
00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:10.925
Sid nodded. "Hello."

17
00:01:10.926 --> 00:01:15.846
Tor looked at Sid's tail.

18
00:01:15.847 --> 00:01:19.754
"I can help," she said.

19
00:01:19.755 --> 00:01:22.802
Rex and Tor grabbed the tail.

20
00:01:22.803 --> 00:01:27.382
They pulled.

21
00:01:27.383 --> 00:01:29.935
Nothing happened.

22
00:01:29.942 --> 00:01:32.762
They pulled harder.

23
00:01:32.763 --> 00:01:35.342
The spike moved.

24
00:01:35.343 --> 00:01:38.165
"It's working!" Rex said.

25
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:40.173
"Pull harder!"

26
00:01:40.174 --> 00:01:46.262
"Grr!" Rex and Tor pulled harder.

27
00:01:46.263 --> 00:01:48.215
The spike popped out!

28
00:01:48.216 --> 00:01:52.179
Sid's tail swung fast.

29
00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:56.843
Thwack!

30
00:01:56.844 --> 00:02:00.182
"Uh-oh," Sid said.

31
00:02:00.183 --> 00:02:05.743
His tail got stuck in a different tree!

